{"page":476,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:78","surah":40,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا رُسُلًا مِّن قَبْلِكَ مِنْهُم مَّن قَصَصْنَا عَلَيْكَ وَمِنْهُم مَّن لَّمْ نَقْصُصْ عَلَيْكَ ۗ وَمَا كَانَ لِرَسُولٍ أَن يَأْتِىَ بِـَٔايَةٍ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ فَإِذَا جَآءَ أَمْرُ ٱللَّهِ قُضِىَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَخَسِرَ هُنَالِكَ ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have sent other messengers before you- some We have mentioned to you and some We have not- and no messenger could bring about a sign except with God’s permission. When [the Day] God ordained comes, just judgement will be passed between them: there and then, those who followed falsehood will be lost.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُسُلًۭا","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"rusulan","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنْهُم","en_gloss":"Among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are) who ","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَصَصْنَا","en_gloss":"We have related","transliteration":"qaṣaṣnā","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"and among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are) who ","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَقْصُصْ","en_gloss":"We have related","transliteration":"naqṣuṣ","verse_key":"40:78"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ ۗ","en_gloss":"to you",