ve they not travelled through the land and seen how those who lived before them met their end? They were more numerous than them, stronger than them, and made a more impressive mark on the land, yet what they achieved was of no use to them at all.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do they not","transliteration":"afalam","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسِيرُوا۟","en_gloss":"travel","transliteration":"yasīrū","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"through","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَيَنظُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and see","transliteration":"fayanẓurū","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"more numerous","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"than them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَشَدَّ","en_gloss":"and mightier","transliteration":"wa-ashadda","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قُوَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) strength","transliteration":"quwwatan","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَءَاثَارًۭا","en_gloss":"and impressions","transliteration":"waāthāran","verse_key":"40:82"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse